<title>SWEDEN: TABLE-Swedish producer prices fall 0.1 pct in June.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Swedish producer prices fall 0.1 pct in June.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish producer prices fell by 0.1 percent in June from May, for a 1.7 percent rise year on year, Statistics Sweden said on Friday.  </p>
<p> SWEDISH PRODUCER PRICES	 June 97    May 97    June 96</p>
<p>  Month-on-month change	  -0.1	 +0.7	-0.3</p>
<p>  Year-on-year change	    +1.7	 +1.4	-3.5</p>
<p>  Index (base 100=1990)	  119.6	119.7	117.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Economists expected producer prices to rise by 0.3 percent in June, a Reuters poll showed.</p>
</text>
